  m_text: '<line-height=1.5em><size=125%><u><align=center>The<#80ff80> Style</color>
    Tag in <smallcaps>TextMesh<#40A0FF>Pro</color></smallcaps></u></size></align>

    </line-height>The
    <<#FFFF00>style="custom style name"</color>> tag makes it possible to define
    custom styles which combine several tags into a single one for convenience.


    Using
    <<#FFFF00>style="H1"</color>> for instance sets the text to <<#FFFF00>size=2em</color>><<#FFFF00>b</color>><<#FFFF00>#40ff80</color>>.


    <style="H1">H1<style="H2">
    H2 <style="H3">H3</style></style></style>


    Style are defined in the <#80ff80>TMP
    Default Style Sheet</color>.'
